  "description": "Subject Manager is an XrmToolBox tool for the bulk management of Dynamics 365 / Dataverse subjects.\n\n- Load the whole subject tree into a grid\n- Edit name, parent subject and visibility, one by one or on many rows at once (set parent, set visibility, find and replace)\n- Create new subjects and delete subjects together with their sub-subjects\n- Live tree preview of the result, as it will look in the CRM, before saving\n- Export to Excel in tree order\n- Save everything in one go with ExecuteMultiple: creates top-down, updates, deletes bottom-up, with automatic retries and an error report",
